{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14099","headline":"苦哉行五首 一 · 戎昱","name":"苦哉行五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彼鼠侵我厨，纵狸授粱肉。\n鼠虽爲君却，狸食自须足。\n冀雪大国耻，翻是大国辱。\n羶腥逼绮罗，砖瓦杂珠玉。\n登楼非骋望，目笑是心哭。\n何意天乐中，至今奏胡曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}